<section class="panel-white">
  <div class="section max-w-3xl">
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">Elite racehorses place extraordinary demands on their bodies. During intense training and competition, maintaining physiological homeostasis becomes essential for consistent performance, efficient recovery, and long-term athletic health.</p>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">At Animalife we believe that the value of the kidney's as it relates to equine performance has been vastly overlooked. We believe that a healthy kidney that functions in a state of homeostasis is a major contributor to a horse's performance on race day; its recovery and long-term wellness.</p>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">Product trials to date have shown significant improvements in training sessions, race day performance, post-race recovery times and a reduction in time between races.</p>
  </div>
</section>

