    <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">Participation is limited. Applications will be evaluated based on racing experience, stable profile, geographic representation, and willingness to provide meaningful feedback. Submission of an application does not guarantee acceptance into the program.</p>
  </div>
</section>

